@startuml
title Verify student status | FR-002/019 | BR-002/003/005/070
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
start
:Student requests a private document upload link;
:Student uploads proof of student status;
:Student submits the document, school name and major;
if (Already awaiting review or approved?) then (Yes)
 :Refuse another active submission;
 stop
endif
if (Is the document registered to this Student?) then (Yes)
 :Save the submission as Awaiting review;
else (No)
 :Refuse a missing document or another person's document;
 stop
endif
:Administrator reviews the submitted proof;
if (Approve student status?) then (Yes)
 :Save the approval;
else (No)
 :Save the rejection with a reason;
endif
:Update the student's eligibility\nin the relevant parts of SkillSwap;
note right
 The current submission checks document ownership.
 It does not verify that the uploaded file actually exists.
end note
stop
@enduml
